<h1>Don Harmon</h1>
<p>Illinois Senate, 39th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://harmonforillinois.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (harmonforillinois.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>His campaign site lists criminal justice reform and police accountability, LGBTQ equality and voting rights, a balanced budget with tax relief, increased school and early childhood funding, ethics and campaign finance reform, and gun safety measures such as universal background checks as his priorities.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>An attorney with a J.D. and M.B.A. from the University of Chicago, he has represented Oak Park in the Senate since 2003 and has served as Senate President since January 2020.</p>
